    <briefdescription>
<para>A tick label formatter that maps integer tick indices to a user-supplied list of strings. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The tick value is rounded to the nearest integer and used as an index into <computeroutput>labels</computeroutput>. Values outside the list range are rendered as empty strings.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1NumericTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">NumericTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">TickLabelFormatter</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
